{
  "title": "React Starter Kit \u2014 SaaS (23,591\u2605)",
  "content": "Project: React Starter Kit\nDomain: SaaS | Scale: medium | Stars: 23,591\nProblem: Provides a production-ready, type-safe full-stack monorepo template for building SaaS applications with modern React and edge computing. Eliminates boilerplate setup by bundling authentication, billing, database, and deployment infrastructure into a cohesive starter kit.\nTarget users: SaaS founders and product teams, Full-stack JavaScript developers, Teams prioritizing type safety and developer experience, Projects targeting edge deployment\nCore features: Type-safe full-stack development with TypeScript, tRPC, and Drizzle ORM; Built-in authentication with Better Auth (email OTP, passkeys, OAuth, organizations); Stripe subscription billing integration; Edge-native deployment to Cloudflare Workers with service bindings; Modern React 19 frontend with TanStack Router, Query, and Tailwind CSS v4; PostgreSQL database with Drizzle ORM, migrations, and seed data; Astro marketing site and React Email templates; Comprehensive documentation with VitePress and AI assistants\nIntegrations: Stripe (payment processing and subscriptions), Better Auth (authentication provider), Cloudflare Workers (serverless runtime and deployment), Neon PostgreSQL (managed database), Google OAuth, Cloudflare Hyperdrive (database acceleration)\nTech stack: React 19, TanStack Router, TanStack Query, Jotai, Tailwind CSS v4, shadcn/ui, Vite + Hono, tRPC, Better Auth, Cloudflare Workers + Drizzle ORM, Neon PostgreSQL + Cloudflare Workers, Terraform, Docker\nKey libraries: react@19, trpc, drizzle-orm, better-auth, hono, tanstack-router, tanstack-query, jotai, stripe, tailwindcss@4, shadcn-ui, astro, react-email, vite, vitest\nArchitecture: serverless\nDesign lessons:\n- Monorepo with independent deployment per app (web, app, api) to Cloudflare Workers using service bindings for inter-app communication\n- Type safety prioritized across all layers\u2014TypeScript, tRPC, and Drizzle create a single type contract from database schema to UI components\n- Developer experience optimized with Bun runtime, Vite/Vitest, pre-configured VSCode settings, AI-powered documentation assistants, and edge-native workflows\n- Production-ready templates include auth with multiple strategies (OTP, passkeys, OAuth), billing integration, database migrations, seed data, and infrastructure-as-code (Terraform)",
